//     +externalLink{https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/KeyboardEvent/key,event.key})</i></li>
//  <li>+link{EventHandler.getKeyEventCharacter()} - the character that was typed. This is derived from the
//      reported characterValue and will only be populated for keyPress events on character keys.</li>
//  <li>+link{EventHandler.getKeyEventCharacterValue()} - the characterValue from the event.
//      This is populated for keyPress events on character keys.</li>
//  <li>+link{EventHandler.getKeyEventKey()} - the reported
//      +externalLink{https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/KeyboardEvent/key,event.key}
//      from the native browser event.</li>
//  <li>+link{EventHandler.getKeyEventCode()} - the reported
//      +externalLink{https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/KeyboardEvent/code,event.code}
