// This method is roughly a clickMask for specific events on a specific target component or
// locator.
// It's roughly analagous to a soft-cancel clickMask except it doesn't mask the entire screen,
// has no concept of z-index, and doesn't auto-hide
// Unlike hard masks, or canvas.componentMask, it just intereferes with our event bubbling
// flow - there's no actual "mask" element rendered out.
// Used by the Tour subsystem to limit interactions with certain targets
_limitedEvents:{},
_limitedEventsByType:{},
_limitedEventID:0,
// Arguments:
// - component to restrict events on
// - allowedEvents: block all events except these
// - callback (optional): If passed, this will be fired on a blocked event, with the eventType
//     as an argument. Somewhat analagous to ClickMask clickAction
// Optional args:
// - locator: if passed events will only be restricted over this locator
