//> @method canvas.supportsVoiceCommands()
// If this method returns true and VoiceAssist has been activated by triple-tapping the
// +link{voiceAssist.voiceKey, Control key}, the user may dictate a command to this
// Canvas.
// <p>
// When this method returns true, the widget must also implement +link{canvas.doVoiceCommand}.
