// releases the key, <code>doVoiceCommand</code> is invoked with the final dictated-text,
// allowing the canvas to display it or process it in some way, such as saving it to a database
// or providing it to an AI for processing.
// <p>
// A developer may also observe +link{voiceAssist.recordingProgress} to access the interim
// command-transcription interactively as the user speaks.
