// @param record (Record | number) record (or row number) to select
// @param [newState] (boolean) new selection state (if null, defaults to true)
// @param rowNum (Integer) row number to select.  Required for
//                         +link{Tree.multiLinkTree,multi-link trees} unless row number is
//                         passed in the "record" param
//
// @see Selection
// @group selection
